      "data": {
        "text": "\"Create stream_chunks.py in the current working directory.\nTask: streams audio chunks from an async source.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc0d4717001ubitJ9q4DxcHqH",
